<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#b">Kirche</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Santa Agne&#x017F;e e Sta. Co&#x017F;tanza,</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">beide vor der</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Porta Pia.</hi> <note place="foot" n="2)">Hr. D. Volkmann S. 260. Titi S. 293.</note></head><lb/>
<div n="4"><head><hi rendition="#g">In der er&#x017F;ten.</hi></head><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#in">E</hi>ine Statue der heil. Agne&#x017F;e.</hi> Gewand von<lb/>
