<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#b">Kirche</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">S. Luigi de&#x2019; France&#x017F;i.</hi> <note place="foot" n="54)">Hr. D. Volkmann S. 469. Titi S. 145. und<lb/>
